<title>USA: Exabyte searches for president, CEO.</title>
<headline>Exabyte searches for president, CEO.</headline>
<dateline>BOULDER, CO. 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Exabyte Corp said on Tuesday that chairman Peter Behrendt is dropping the title of president/chief executive officer, and the company is looking for someone to fill the post.</p>
<p>Exabyte said the business has become complex since it was founded a decade ago, warranting the additional executive post.</p>
<p>Behrendt joined Exabyte as president in 1987, and has held both the chairman and president/CEO positions since January 1992.</p>
